    coreHi: '`tools=[...]` ke saath ==`tool_choice` (`auto`, `required`, `none`)== control karta hai ki model tool call kare ya direct text de—aur modern LLMs ek hi turn mein ==parallel tool calls== bhi bhej sakte hain!',
