    coreHi: 'LLM ke banaye har tool argument ko ==untrusted input== maano: pehle ==tool allowlist== check karo, phir ==Pydantic se types/ranges/regex validate== karo, aur tabhi function execute karo.',
    analogyTitle: 'Bouncer Checking Both Name on Guest List and ID Validity',
    analogyEn: 'Even if the LLM asks for `refund(amount=-5000)` or `limit=999999`, your ==Pydantic validator blocks it before the database is ever touched==.',
